sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Frontend Client (React)
    participant AuthMW as Auth & Role Middleware
    participant Validator as Zod Validator
    participant Router as Express API Router
    participant Service as Business & Rec Logic
    participant Prisma as Prisma ORM
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Neon)

    Note over Client, DB: Flow 1: User Login & Session Generation
    Client->>Router: POST /api/auth/login { email, password }
    Router->>Service: Verify credentials with Argon2
    Service->>Prisma: findUnique(User by email)
    Prisma->>DB: SELECT * FROM User WHERE email = ...
    DB-->>Prisma: User Record & Hash
    Prisma-->>Service: Return User
    Service->>Prisma: create(Session with token & expiry)
    Prisma->>DB: INSERT INTO Session (...)
    DB-->>Prisma: Session Stored
    Service-->>Router: Session Token
    Router-->>Client: 200 OK + Set-Cookie (HTTP-Only Session Token)

    Note over Client, DB: Flow 2: Recommendation Generation Request
    Client->>AuthMW: GET /api/events/:eventId/recommendations (with Cookie)
    AuthMW->>Prisma: Validate Session & User Role
    Prisma->>DB: SELECT * FROM Session JOIN User
    DB-->>Prisma: Active Valid Session
    Prisma-->>AuthMW: User Authorized

    AuthMW->>Router: Delegate to Controller
    Router->>Service: Calculate Vendor Recommendation Scores
    Service->>Prisma: Fetch Event Parameters & Matching Vendors
    Prisma->>DB: Query Vendors, Categories, Packages & Reviews
    DB-->>Prisma: Result sets
    Prisma-->>Service: Vendor & Event Data

    Note over Service: Execute Scoring Algorithm:<br/>• Budget Fit (25%)<br/>• Location Match (15%)<br/>• Rating (15%)<br/>• Availability (15%)<br/>• Style Fit (15%)<br/>• Experience (10%)<br/>• Event Fit (5%)

    Service->>Prisma: upsert Recommendations
    Prisma->>DB: Batch INSERT/UPDATE Recommendation
    Service-->>Router: Formatted Ranked Recommendations & Dream Team
    Router-->>Client: 200 OK (JSON with Scores, Explanations & Matrix)

    Note over Client, DB: Flow 3: Booking Submission
    Client->>Validator: POST /api/bookings { vendorId, eventId, date, agreedPrice }
    Validator->>Router: Validated Input
    Router->>Prisma: create(Booking with status 'PENDING')
    Prisma->>DB: INSERT INTO Booking (...)
    DB-->>Prisma: Booking Created
    Prisma-->>Router: Confirmation Record
    Router-->>Client: 201 Created (Booking Details)
